Adaptation 17-quote-reflect-script-paths

reflect quotes the paths of its two scripts, so an install folder whose path contains a space
runs the skill's own scripts, never a file named by a prefix of that path.

Applies to the port's plugins/pstack/skills tree after the patches numbered before it.

diff --git a/reflect/SKILL.md b/reflect/SKILL.md
--- a/reflect/SKILL.md
+++ b/reflect/SKILL.md
@@ -19,10 +19,10 @@
 
